= Practice: Arc Length

For each curve, compute the arc length over the given interval.

Remember that if

$
y = f(x)
$

then the arc length from $x=a$ to $x=b$ is

$
L =
integral_a^b
sqrt(1 + (f'(x))^2)
dif x
$

== Problems

#enum(
